{
  "name": "dsh-session-cleaner",
  "version": "0.8.1-mod.1",
  "description": "DSH 会话清理插件（本地改造版）：侧栏「···」菜单删除会话，删除前列出产出文件（区分交付物与中间产物，默认全选，取消勾选即保留），父会话与子代理整棵树一起进回收站；同步摘掉工作区记账、置顶、归档标记，清掉投影缓存行（含 .bak 备份）与绑定定时任务，移动后复核原路径确已消失（不假成功）。产出文件是搬进回收站而不是删除，恢复会话时原路搬回；回收站 15 天自动清空。标题读取改为「日志最后一条 session/title」并带 mtime 缓存与磁盘缓存，列表 16 路并发读取。基于 jackxiao17/dsh-session-cleaner 0.7.7 修改，另见 NOTICE。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "mjj2-pro",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "plugin",
    "session",
    "delete",
    "recycle-bin",
    "cleaner"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/mjj2-pro/dsh-session-cleaner-mod.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/mjj2-pro/dsh-session-cleaner-mod#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/mjj2-pro/dsh-session-cleaner-mod/issues"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./locale/*.md": "./locale/*.md",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "locale",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "NOTICE",
    "licenses",
    "DEVELOPMENT.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.15.0 || >=24.0.0",
    "dsh": ">=0.2.1 <0.3.0"
  }
}
